  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A dignified life for the forgotten girls of India</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rajasthan, India. Thousands of girls inherit HIV at birth. From the poorest caste, at the age of 6 or 7 they see their parents die from the virus. They do not appear in any registry and the rest of their families disowns them... they are invisible. Alone, with nothing, hungry and afraid, they wander the city until the virus destroys their immune system and they fall ill in the ditch of some road. Help us giving them a Home, Medical care, Feeding, and Schooling... Help us giving them a LIFE...</narrative>
  </description>
